     "latex": "F_X(x)=\\int_{-1}^{x}\\frac32t^2\\,dt=\\frac{x^3+1}{2}\\quad(0\\text{ left of }-1,\\ 1\\text{ right of }1)"
    },
    {
     "explanation": "(b) **Mean:** $x\\cdot x^2=x^3$ is odd on $[-1,1]$.",
     "latex": "E[X]=\\int_{-1}^{1}\\frac32x^3\\,dx=0"
    },
    {
     "explanation": "**Second moment.**",
     "latex": "E[X^2]=\\int_{-1}^{1}\\frac32x^4\\,dx=\\frac32\\cdot\\frac25=\\frac35"
    },
    {
     "explanation": "**Subtract.**",
     "latex": "\\operatorname{Var}(X)=\\frac35-0^2=\\frac35"
    }
   ],
   "answer": "$C=\\tfrac32$, $F_X(x)=\\tfrac{x^3+1}{2}$ on $[-1,1]$; $E[X]=0$, $\\operatorname{Var}(X)=\\tfrac35$.",
