     "explanation": "**$E[y]$:** weight each mass $m$ by $\\frac{m}{560}$.",
     "latex": "E[y]=\\frac{140^2+112^2+125^2+183^2}{560}=\\frac{81258}{560}"
    },
    {
     "explanation": "Evaluate.",
     "latex": "E[y]\\approx145.10\\text{ g}>140\\text{ g}"
    }
